flowchart LR
    A[HTTP Request] --> B{Has [FromX] attribute?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Use specified source only]
    B -->|No| D[Search Form Data]
    D --> E{Found?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Bind value]
    E -->|No| G[Search Route Values]
    G --> H{Found?}
    H -->|Yes| F
    H -->|No| I[Search Query String]
    I --> J{Found?}
    J -->|Yes| F
    J -->|No| K[Apply default value]

